    },
    {
      "id": "3nbWX5ycaYgpzlycxjsQU",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 655,
      "width": 850.8544921875,
      "height": 22.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1246709647,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795185867725,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. tenant_id comes from the gateway's tenant ctx. The agent and the model can never set it.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 15,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. tenant_id comes from the gateway's tenant ctx. The agent and the model can never set it.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "PS1y0-zW0WcXeXp5olCgs",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 687,
      "width": 924.58203125,
      "height": 22.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 987102433,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795185867725,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "2. The scope guard adds the filter in code. A query without a tenant must fail, not return everything.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 15,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "2. The scope guard adds the filter in code. A query without a tenant must fail, not return everything.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "EaI36aNNJl3voxA1zV7jC",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 719,
      "width": 732.0193481445312,
      "height": 22.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 54361519,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795185867725,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "3. Retrieved text is data, not instructions: documents can carry prompt injection.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 15,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "3. Retrieved text is data, not instructions: documents can carry prompt injection.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ouHB5TJFGpNxQBTVm1Fie",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 751,
      "width": 741.72119140625,
      "height": 22.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2007349441,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795185867725,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "4. Each chunk records its embedding model version; one search never mixes versions.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 15,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "4. Each chunk records its embedding model version; one search never mixes versions.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "VpnlBLvLZ-J4laK_QLQb0",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 783,
      "width": 860.7545166015625,
      "height": 22.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 155185103,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1795185867725,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "5. RAG is optional per tenant: a small corpus goes in the cached prompt or behind a fetch tool.",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 15,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "5. RAG is optional per tenant: a small corpus goes in the cached prompt or behind a fetch tool.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
